[{"answer":"Colin, I'm really struggling to think of a topic for our human geography assignment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Me too, Rosie.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll tell you what, let's think about the different aspects of human geography","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and see if we can narrow the topic down a bit to help us decide.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/5.mp3"},{"answer":"So one aspect is population.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/6.mp3"},{"answer":"That would be all about population density and migration and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Lots of facts and statistics.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe a bit boring?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, but quite straightforward to find on the internet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Suppose so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/11.mp3"},{"answer":"How about health?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd never thought about the links between that and geography until Professor Lee gave us that lecture on cholera -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/13.mp3"},{"answer":"how in the 19th century, a physician used street plans and plans of water supplies to find the source of a cholera epidemic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, fascinating, wasn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Or we could do something more general like economies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/16.mp3"},{"answer":"So how financial and commercial factors are linked to the physical environment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought that had been taken off the syllabus for this year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Has it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not sure...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/20.mp3"},{"answer":"but it might be best to avoid it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe we could do something on culture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/23.mp3"},{"answer":"We had that lecture about culture and geography last week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't get much out of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/25.mp3"},{"answer":"It was all so general and the lecturer didn't give any useful examples.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I hardly took any notes... it didn't seem worth it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Me neither.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/28.mp3"},{"answer":"We could focus on poverty.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/29.mp3"},{"answer":"That's something that's a global problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/30.mp3"},{"answer":"The trouble is, Dr Lee was saying, that you have to be careful with some of the figures relating to poverty.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/31.mp3"},{"answer":"They're sometimes deliberately manipulated.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/32.mp3"},{"answer":"You mean the information gets changed for political reasons?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/33.mp3"},{"answer":"That sort of thing, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/34.mp3"},{"answer":"So what are we going to do our assignment on?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll tell you what.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/36.mp3"},{"answer":"One of the possibilities we haven't discussed is urbanisation","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/37.mp3"},{"answer":"and now over half the world's population lives in cities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/38.mp3"},{"answer":"That's really important.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, good idea, Rosie.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I love living in a big city but of course there are problems.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Things like theft and robbery?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but where I come from, that's linked to another more serious issue,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/44.mp3"},{"answer":"which is that a lot of people don't have jobs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/45.mp3"},{"answer":"That's getting worse and worse.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/46.mp3"},{"answer":"And we also still have quite a lot of people who are homeless,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/47.mp3"},{"answer":"though that's not quite so bad as it was.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/48.mp3"},{"answer":"It'd be nice to talk about some positive developments,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/49.mp3"},{"answer":"like some of the new developments on the outskirts of cities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, they've opened some massive new shopping centres outside my city.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, the same with mine,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/52.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's meant a lot of the shops in the city centre are closing down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/53.mp3"},{"answer":"But the outskirts are ideal for buildings that need a lot of space, like for conferences.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/54.mp3"},{"answer":"They've opened a couple of big ones.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we've got some too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/56.mp3"},{"answer":"It'd be nicer to have more facilities for things like football too,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/57.mp3"},{"answer":"but that's not happening where I live.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Same in my area.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/59.mp3"},{"answer":"We could include something about developing disused industrial sites.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/60.mp3"},{"answer":"It seems like a good idea because you're not doing any harm to the natural environment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, but aren't the buildings architecturally significant?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Not really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/63.mp3"},{"answer":"And what people forget is that they often used quite dangerous materials, chemicals and things,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/64.mp3"},{"answer":"which haven't been properly cleared away, so the whole site has to be made safe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm, that can't be cheap.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/66.mp3"},{"answer":"And I bet it's often not budgeted for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/67.mp3"},{"answer":"You're right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you read about Masdar City?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/69.mp3"},{"answer":"In Abu Dhabi? Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/70.mp3"},{"answer":"It was designed to be a green city, wasn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/71.mp3"},{"answer":"That might be a good example of a city which set out to depend entirely on renewable energy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes we should say something about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/73.mp3"},{"answer":"It was designed to be totally pedestrianised too, wasn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/74.mp3"},{"answer":"With the transport underground.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes and they had big plans for recycling to reduce waste to the lowest possible level.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/76.mp3"},{"answer":"But let's stick to talking about power sources.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there's that ecotown in England, Greenhill Abbotts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/78.mp3"},{"answer":"It set out to conform to the usual principles, sustainability and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/79.mp3"},{"answer":"A lot of people were against it at first.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/80.mp3"},{"answer":"They said the plans were unrealistic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/81.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not sure how far they've got with it...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/82.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll check.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/84.mp3"},{"answer":"So it looks as if we have a sort of plan...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-2-part-3-2025-07-21-19-42-10/85.mp3"}]
